    "note": "UNTESTABLE at the 50,000 JPY promotion capital, not disproven. The primary report is identical to the baseline in every field except orders_below_min (5960 -> 1340), so sharpe_absolute_delta is exactly 0.000 -- the same shape as the CoinGecko constant-volume VWMA, where 0.0 was arithmetic rather than evidence. The gate demonstrably fired (4,620 would-be reversals suppressed) but all of them were already being dropped by the lot floor. At 500k it cut trades 754 -> 288 (-62%), doubled win rate 0.117 -> 0.246, and improved return -16.09% -> -11.20% and Sharpe -29.57 -> -19.36."
